    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dive into Terror with Breaking the Grip!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breaking the Grip is an asymmetrical multiplayer game blending horror and strategy. Survivors and the Spirit engage in a psychological battle: one seeks to escape its grasp, while the other drags them into madness. Only teamwork, cunning, and nerves of steel will lead to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you be the one to survive\u2026 or the shadow that hunts them to their last breath?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Rules</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Roles:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survivors</strong>: Their goal is to perform a ritual to weaken the Spirit and break free. They must collect key items, use their abilities wisely, and avoid succumbing to madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Spirit</strong>: Its mission is to terrify and weaken Survivors until they are vulnerable enough to be eliminated. It uses supernatural abilities to manipulate and obstruct them.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd39 Gameplay Phases:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1\ufe0f\u20e3 <strong>Candle Collection</strong><br>Survivors must explore the map and gather <strong>5 candles</strong> scattered throughout the area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2\ufe0f\u20e3 <strong>Banishment Ritual</strong><br>Once all candles are collected, Survivors must complete a ritual to weaken the Spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3\ufe0f\u20e3 <strong>Weapon of Deliverance</strong><br>After the ritual, Survivors must retrieve <strong>the Celestial Dagger</strong>, the only weapon capable of killing the Spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4\ufe0f\u20e3 <strong>Final Confrontation</strong><br>Survivors must strike the Spirit with the Celestial Dagger before it eliminates them all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd39 Abilities &amp; Mechanics:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe2 <strong>Survivors \u2013 Special Powers</strong><br>Each Survivor has a unique ability:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diversion Decoy:</strong> Forcefully teleports the Spirit to a fake point of interest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desperate Dash</strong>: A temporary sprint to escape danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Momentary Immunity</strong>: Grants brief resistance to the Spirit\u2019s grasp.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Illuminator</strong>: Uses a special light to repel the Spirit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spirit Tracker</strong>: Briefly reveals the Spirit\u2019s location.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rapid Meditation</strong>: Recovers from fear effects faster.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 <strong>Spirit \u2013 Powers of Terror</strong><br>The Spirit can spread fear and manipulate the environment:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epidemic Terror</strong>: Increases madness in nearby Survivors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Portal Master</strong>: Instantly teleports across the map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mirror Master</strong>: Creates illusions to trap Survivors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spectral Phase</strong>: Moves through walls and obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spectral Mark</strong>: Curses a Survivor, making them more vulnerable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Puppeteer</strong>: Takes brief control of a Survivor\u2019s actions.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd39 Win Conditions:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Survivor Victory</strong>: Complete the ritual and eliminate the Spirit using the Celestial Dagger.<br>\u274c <strong>Spirit Victory</strong>: Drive all Survivors into madness and eliminate them one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a psychological battle where every decision shapes your fate. <strong>The Spirit is patient\u2026 but will you be?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dive into Terror with Breaking the Grip!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breaking the Grip is an asymmetrical multiplayer game blending horror and strategy. Survivors and the Spirit engage in a psychological battle: one seeks to escape its grasp, while the other drags them into madness. Only teamwork, cunning, and nerves of steel will lead to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you be the one to survive\u2026 or the shadow that hunts them to their last breath?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Rules</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Roles:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survivors</strong>: Their goal is to perform a ritual to weaken the Spirit and break free. They must collect key items, use their abilities wisely, and avoid succumbing to madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Spirit</strong>: Its mission is to terrify and weaken Survivors until they are vulnerable enough to be eliminated. It uses supernatural abilities to manipulate and obstruct them.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd39 Gameplay Phases:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1\ufe0f\u20e3 <strong>Candle Collection</strong><br>Survivors must explore the map and gather <strong>5 candles</strong> scattered throughout the area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2\ufe0f\u20e3 <strong>Banishment Ritual</strong><br>Once all candles are collected, Survivors must complete a ritual to weaken the Spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3\ufe0f\u20e3 <strong>Weapon of Deliverance</strong><br>After the ritual, Survivors must retrieve <strong>the Celestial Dagger</strong>, the only weapon capable of killing the Spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4\ufe0f\u20e3 <strong>Final Confrontation</strong><br>Survivors must strike the Spirit with the Celestial Dagger before it eliminates them all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd39 Abilities &amp; Mechanics:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe2 <strong>Survivors \u2013 Special Powers</strong><br>Each Survivor has a unique ability:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diversion Decoy:</strong> Forcefully teleports the Spirit to a fake point of interest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desperate Dash</strong>: A temporary sprint to escape danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Momentary Immunity</strong>: Grants brief resistance to the Spirit\u2019s grasp.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Illuminator</strong>: Uses a special light to repel the Spirit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spirit Tracker</strong>: Briefly reveals the Spirit\u2019s location.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rapid Meditation</strong>: Recovers from fear effects faster.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 <strong>Spirit \u2013 Powers of Terror</strong><br>The Spirit can spread fear and manipulate the environment:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epidemic Terror</strong>: Increases madness in nearby Survivors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Portal Master</strong>: Instantly teleports across the map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mirror Master</strong>: Creates illusions to trap Survivors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spectral Phase</strong>: Moves through walls and obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spectral Mark</strong>: Curses a Survivor, making them more vulnerable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Puppeteer</strong>: Takes brief control of a Survivor\u2019s actions.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd39 Win Conditions:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Survivor Victory</strong>: Complete the ritual and eliminate the Spirit using the Celestial Dagger.<br>\u274c <strong>Spirit Victory</strong>: Drive all Survivors into madness and eliminate them one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a psychological battle where every decision shapes your fate. <strong>The Spirit is patient\u2026 but will you be?</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Breaking the Grip is a multiplayer horror and strategy game. As a survivor, complete a ritual to eliminate the spirit before it drives you insane. As the spirit, spread terror and break their will. Who will prevail between life and the beyond?",
